    "完整原state七命名函数、当前slot/reflection/frame/profile/ports/night-bindings与两新unit全读；其他旧消费者十六精确delta均为既定import/展示入口/中文说明/实际init接线，未换原actions/assert/oracle。",
    "原data先拒Proxy再仅读自身descriptor，不新增exact-keys/plain prototype/writable约束；get保持原role/privateState/state引用，shot→remaining→policy原读取序与0/1资源接受面保持。project保policy→shotPolicy→reflectionRemaining三个字段及原返回undefined。",
    "槽安装先求原左值privateState再读取原creator参数；parameters.parse(ctx.boardConfig?.evilKnight??{}).shotPolicy仅在原RHS调用位置晚求值，不提前parse或赋值。原单参数末逗号仅证明语法逆，不属于玩法。",
    "原capture按World.getComponent(target.id,Role)→getState→role/state/living短路，捕获privateState/shotPolicy原ref；binding仍原plain mutable对象，isCurrent闭包逐原生命/Roleref/容器/getStateref/shotPolicy复验。",
    "commit仍先caster Role lookup和触发Role枚举，然后binding/current/remaining/living/sourcecallback/身份/camp原顺序；caster privateState先捕获。唯一consumeReflection在原位置晚读binding.state写0，不额外get/schema、未另建WeakMap/影子资源。",
    "付款后才读binding.target.id构造attack；target getter失败不退款。attack.isCurrent保binding→剩余0→原生命→source callback→Roleref→角色→camp→原容器短路。免疫政策独立于余量，不把玩家DTO授资格。",
    "frame原roster WeakMap/abilityIdentity/引用检查、Map构建/安装与免疫数组顺序不迁；night-bindings本批只type route/准确归属说明，捕获同一Map的query/runtime闭包仍原owner。",
    "ports真实三条具名出口：commit指reflection；get和新增project指slot。同一函数，没有writer barrel或命令wrapper；Observer纯route不改投影body。所有角色中文名准确为恶夜骑士，重要付款/getter/失败说明符合实际代码。"
